  {
    "id": 4001089080090,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "最近、うちはアイドルになっとらんやったら、\r\nどがんしとったとやろ……",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400108908/4001089080090"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001089080100,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "どがん生き方ばしとったとやろって、考えるきっかけの\r\nあったと～",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400108908/4001089080100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "劇団俳優",
    "text": "（恋鐘さん……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001089080110,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "何回考えても、うちはやっぱり『アイドル』じゃなか\r\n生き方はしとらんやったと思う",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400108908/4001089080110"
  },
  {
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "1121",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2500
  },
  {
    "id": 4001089080120,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "……うちはファンのみんなや周りの人のおかげで、\r\n職業の『アイドル』として",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400108908/4001089080120"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001089080130,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "『アイドル』の生き方ばするっていう夢ば\r\n叶えられてきたばってん……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400108908/4001089080130"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001089080140,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "夢の叶う人だけおるわけじゃなかよね……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400108908/4001089080140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "劇団俳優",
    "text": "────っ……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "autoWaitTime": 1100
  },
  {
    "id": 4001089080150,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "今も大変か思いしとる人もおって……\r\nそがんことで、悩んどる人もおると思う",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400108908/4001089080150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "劇団俳優",
    "text": "（そう……悩んで悩んでしんどくて\r\nもう辞めようって思って……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001089080160,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "うちは……そいまで頑張ってきたこととか、\r\n打ち込んできたことばなかったことにしてほしくなか……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400108908/4001089080160"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001089080170,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "なかったことにせんでも\r\nよかとじゃなかかって思うばい～",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400108908/4001089080170"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001089080180,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "ここにおるうちら……アンティーカも\r\nみんなそれぞれ今までいろんなことのあって",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400108908/4001089080180"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001089080190,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "そいをぜーんぶ受け止めて、ここにおるけん……",
